<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Intel Corp.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Intel Corp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Intel Corp common stock, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co oHG said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> PAYDATE	01.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF STG	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE   ISS PRICE  PREMIUM    GEARING  MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A    $100.00  2.65 DEM   21.84 PCT  5.49 X   23.JAN.98</p>
<p> CALL B    $120.00  2.72 DEM   43.06 PCT  5.35 X   22.JAN.99</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
